{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Train Cargo Simulator!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, trains arrive with crates full of mixed goods. unload them swiftly, sort their contents with precision, and prepare every order exactly as required. The company counts on efficiency, and all valued workers are always dependable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/4fc0aa05b52045b40b08971dfb8e073c.avif?t=1757453064\" width=900 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/83a9ff0556f9d5414234819fa8469f94.poster.avif?t=1757453064\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/83a9ff0556f9d5414234819fa8469f94.webm?t=1757453064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/83a9ff0556f9d5414234819fa8469f94.mp4?t=1757453064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Move incoming crates from wagons into the warehouse without delay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/efe6f93d32c772430899996920476421.avif?t=1757453064\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/1ebaf7d29dc591180be697708f2ed009.poster.avif?t=1757453064\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/1ebaf7d29dc591180be697708f2ed009.webm?t=1757453064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/1ebaf7d29dc591180be697708f2ed009.mp4?t=1757453064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpack and organize goods at your workbench, assembling orders exactly as specified.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/4e45c07f2cf5a3d2112d0b222790b0e2.avif?t=1757453064\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/28e4842355dafd8f79a3783984cd0353.poster.avif?t=1757453064\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/28e4842355dafd8f79a3783984cd0353.webm?t=1757453064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/extras/28e4842355dafd8f79a3783984cd0353.mp4?t=1757453064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Maintain strict order in storage and ensure all outgoing cargo departs on schedule.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The smoother you perform, the less work lingers once the lights off.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why It Matters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Efficient Workflow \u2013</strong> Every second saved keeps the company running flawlessly\u2026 and\u00a0 everything in its place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accurate Orders \u2013</strong> Each perfect shipment reinforces the company\u2019s reputation and any mistake leaves a trace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing Demands \u2013</strong> More trains, more orders, more responsibility\u2026 the company\u2019s expectations never stop grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valued Contribution \u2013</strong> Your productivity strengthens the company, and nothing goes unnoticed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Success here means order, timing, and discipline. Ensure the yard never slows down.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Train Cargo Simulator, you\u2019re more than just an employee\u2014you\u2019re a vital part of a finely tuned system. Keep working hard, stay efficient, and prove you are worthy of the company\u2019s trust. After all, <i>a reliable worker is the most valuable cargo of all.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist today, and begin your career in efficiency. \ud83d\ude82</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968490?t=1757453064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/e926fd9e41c5ea93cacfbc15d5cef625d5f012f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757453064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/6e6f2ac11a325100ea2b2fe5cc034cebed079084/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757453064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/6e6f2ac11a325100ea2b2fe5cc034cebed079084/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757453064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Train Cargo Simulator!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, trains arrive