>Growing Demands \u2013</strong> More trains, more orders, more responsibility\u2026 the company\u2019s expectations never stop grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valued Contribution \u2013</strong> Your productivity strengthens the company, and nothing goes unnoticed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Success here means order, timing, and discipline. Ensure the yard never slows down.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Train Cargo Simulator, you\u2019re more than just an employee\u2014you\u2019re a vital part of a finely tuned system. Keep working hard, stay efficient, and prove you are worthy of the company\u2019s trust. After all, <i>a reliable worker is the most valuable cargo of all.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist today, and begin your career in efficiency. \ud83d\ude82</p>","developers":["Grind Will Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968490/5ba400af7f2ce66b16f9ab13437517608016cfb2/header.jpg?t=1757453064","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Train Cargo Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 10400, AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970, AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Grind Will Interactive"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"1